  "segments": [
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 6,
      "end": 12.2,
      "text": "Hi, it's Marco with the Friday report for Riverside Block B. Long day but a good one."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 12.2,
      "end": 18.4,
      "text": "Weather first: it rained from seven to ten thirty, we couldn't do block outside on the south facade."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 18.4,
      "end": 24.9,
      "text": "So masonry outside stood down about three and a half hours, we moved those guys inside to do the interior block on two."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 24.9,
      "end": 32.1,
      "text": "Then we poured the deck on four, like sixty-eight yards, finished around two thirty, Apex had six guys all day on that."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 32.1,
      "end": 39,
      "text": "BrightLine, five electricians full day on three, rough-in is about sixty percent now."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 39,
      "end": 46.5,
      "text": "The Delta guys were on two doing the ductwork in the east wing, all day too."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 46.5,
      "end": 53.2,
      "text": "Ironclad had three guys tying rebar for the five deck, full day, and they brought two loads of rebar around one o'clock."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 53.2,
      "end": 59.8,
      "text": "Our guys, four laborers all day, cleanup and helping the pour."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 59.8,
      "end": 66,
      "text": "Safety, we did the toolbox talk this morning on wet weather access, slippery decks, no incidents, nobody got hurt."
    },
    {
      "callId": "c0110000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "start": 66,
      "end": 73.5,
      "text": "Monday we need the concrete pump at seven for the five deck. That's it."
    }
  ]
}
